          "value": "Surgery at St Stephen's Private Hospital"
        },
        "f2": {
          "value": "Hervey Bay and Fraser Coast patients can have their surgery at St Stephen's Private Hospital in Urraween, so treatment under general anaesthetic happens close to home."
        },
        "f3": {
          "value": "<strong>St Stephen's Private Hospital</strong><br>1 Medical Place, Urraween QLD 4655<br><a href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/place/St+Stephen's+Hospital/@-25.299893,152.8238597,15z\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Get directions</a>"
        },
